# Repository Context

## Intent
Local-first CLI for personal task tracking. Files are the source of
truth; SQLite is a rebuildable index. Optimize for offline use and
zero-configuration startup over feature breadth.

## Constraints
- No ORM. Rejected 2026-03: query opacity broke the offline repair
  path. Raw SQL through the storage module only.
- No network calls on the hot path. The CLI must be fully usable with
  no connectivity; sync is a separate, explicitly invoked command.
- Errors are values, not exceptions, in the core package. Adopted
  2026-04 after exception handling hid two data-loss bugs.

## Evolved Context
- [2026-06-29] pkg X >=3.0 breaks ARM64 builds. Pin to 2.3.x until
  upstream fix lands.
- [2026-06-14] Downstream proxy at staging silently enforces a 45s
  connection timeout; set client timeouts explicitly below that.
